WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:01.730
(Makeshift Fortress Troy)

00:02.020 --> 00:03.440
(Central Hospital)

00:04.570 --> 00:05.790
(After Kurogiri's awakening, Central Hospita)

00:05.790 --> 00:07.270
(After Kurogiri's awakening, Central Hospita)
Bring the wounded inside!

00:07.270 --> 00:08.110
Yeah.

00:08.110 --> 00:10.090
Bring them all inside, friends or not!

00:10.090 --> 00:12.590
Hurry up! The rain is picking up!

00:13.090 --> 00:14.490
Stop right there!

00:14.490 --> 00:15.950
You're in no condition to move.

00:15.950 --> 00:18.450
The wound might open up and kill you!

00:19.430 --> 00:20.770
Shut it already.

00:22.430 --> 00:24.590
Tell me where the enemy is.

00:25.990 --> 00:27.410
Don't order me around.

00:27.730 --> 00:29.710
You're an escaped convict.

00:30.270 --> 00:32.430
Izuku Midoriya

00:32.890 --> 00:34.390
asked me to do this.

00:35.370 --> 00:38.010
Please fight by our side!

00:38.470 --> 00:42.570
You are still a hero at heart!

00:43.290 --> 00:45.370
He asked me

00:46.030 --> 00:47.850
to fight by his side.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.350
Let her be.

00:51.370 --> 00:52.790
But…

00:53.590 --> 00:55.410
I'll take full responsibility
for her actions.

00:56.910 --> 00:59.230
Use this to check on the situation.

00:59.870 --> 01:02.610
It shows the locations of U.A. High
and the enemies.

01:04.110 --> 01:05.530
Lady Nagant.

01:05.890 --> 01:07.590
This great battle

01:07.590 --> 01:11.210
hinges on our faith in Izuku Midoriya.

01:11.670 --> 01:15.250
If your heart tells you to help that kid,

01:16.470 --> 01:18.390
then you have my trust.

01:30.870 --> 01:32.330
It's not over yet.

01:32.330 --> 01:34.230
One more shot to go.

01:34.230 --> 01:36.230
Just let me land another shot!

01:38.590 --> 01:40.430
The grey skies.

01:41.210 --> 01:49.360
You and my successor opened my eyes
after I lost faith in the light.

01:50.690 --> 01:52.590
You helped me remember the time

01:53.050 --> 01:55.310
when I had my shining hopes

01:57.510 --> 01:59.430
and my reason for living.

02:00.590 --> 02:02.930
Let them reach you, Izuku Midoriya.

02:03.730 --> 02:05.590
From Lady Nagant!

02:06.270 --> 02:08.790
Nagant!

02:17.650 --> 02:19.130
Midoriya!

02:19.130 --> 02:22.930
Now that Shigaraki
has regained his Quirks,

02:22.930 --> 02:25.350
we can't keep fighting above the arena.

02:25.350 --> 02:27.190
In that case…

02:43.890 --> 02:48.640
(My Hero Academia Season 7)

03:58.550 --> 04:01.350
A piece of disposable trash!

04:01.350 --> 04:04.970
How dare you still play the victim
after killing your own comrades?

04:05.270 --> 04:07.850
You're nothing but a weakling drifting
wherever the wind blows!

04:09.490 --> 04:12.930
Manipulating her emotions and past?

04:12.930 --> 04:14.330
How disgraceful.

04:14.730 --> 04:17.490
It's time you get those hands
away from me.

04:18.470 --> 04:21.250
You took me in and trained me
for the same reason.

04:21.810 --> 04:26.730
You take advantage of All Might's bond
with Shimura to disgust them.

04:28.390 --> 04:34.110
You put the plan
to take over my body into motion.

04:35.070 --> 04:37.230
The plan was to assimilate my resentment

04:37.630 --> 04:40.650
and steal One For All for yourself.

04:41.770 --> 04:46.130
I became part of you
after our minds merged.

04:47.830 --> 04:49.330
But you know what?

04:49.670 --> 04:51.610
I never want that to happen.

04:52.030 --> 04:54.990
So, I hid my core deep inside me

04:56.130 --> 04:58.230
to keep you from noticing.

04:58.630 --> 05:02.330
That core would slowly help me
regain my consciousness.

05:04.170 --> 05:07.210
Follow the path "I" took.

05:07.670 --> 05:09.970
Kurogiri!

05:10.750 --> 05:13.010
I'm not in control of this body!

05:13.330 --> 05:16.490
Warp me to All For One's location now!

05:17.170 --> 05:18.310
Oh…

05:18.670 --> 05:22.810
I must… Protect… Shi… No…

05:22.810 --> 05:26.790
Shigaraki… Death… Who…

05:26.790 --> 05:28.190
Where…

05:28.190 --> 05:31.850
Dead… Friends…

05:32.750 --> 05:36.090
I have no use for One For All.

05:36.970 --> 05:38.970
Forget about making me your pawn.

05:39.830 --> 05:42.790
Did you really think you had
control over everything?

05:44.110 --> 05:49.410
Unlike the others, my heart
doesn't get swayed so easily.

05:50.010 --> 05:53.470
I only see the world this way

05:53.470 --> 05:56.070
because of my cursed family!

05:58.770 --> 06:01.370
There is only one thing that I want!

06:03.210 --> 06:07.030
Everything that has anything to do
with that family must perish.

06:09.070 --> 06:12.750
Only then can I have salvation,

06:12.750 --> 06:14.410
hero.

06:15.710 --> 06:17.070
Young Midoriya?

06:20.810 --> 06:23.130
Not on my watch.

06:23.530 --> 06:24.930
Even so,

06:25.950 --> 06:29.890
I won't pretend
I can't see the crying boy inside you!

06:31.570 --> 06:35.580
(Hopes)

06:39.390 --> 06:41.850
My Elasticity is at its limit.

06:42.810 --> 06:46.650
Not the limit of love, but my body!

06:46.970 --> 06:48.810
Hang in there just a little bit longer!

06:48.810 --> 06:50.930
I will send in the levitation programme
in a few moments!

06:50.930 --> 06:52.720
The levitation programme is on the way.

06:53.590 --> 06:55.750
It happened too fast.
I couldn't get a good look.

06:56.370 --> 06:59.090
But it was indeed the young man I met.

06:59.670 --> 07:01.810
Now that he has left,

07:02.250 --> 07:04.850
does it mean he's leaving
the place in my hands?

07:05.370 --> 07:09.330
No, he couldn't have known I was here.

07:10.010 --> 07:13.050
There are no cameras or audience.

07:13.330 --> 07:15.610
Whatever I do here won't earn me

07:15.610 --> 07:17.890
any criticisms or cheers.

07:20.610 --> 07:25.010
It's just me and the joy of being alive.

07:30.150 --> 07:32.790
Cameras and an audience!

07:33.190 --> 07:34.690
It's not safe out here!

07:34.690 --> 07:36.250
Get shelter inside!

07:36.250 --> 07:39.250
He is a convict who is supposed
to be serving time in jail.

07:39.250 --> 07:43.150
But at this moment, he is keeping
the Coffin in the Sky from crashing down.

07:43.150 --> 07:44.690
Are you even listening to me?

07:44.690 --> 07:46.450
I'm a bit busy out here!

07:46.450 --> 07:48.210
Go inside!

07:48.630 --> 07:50.570
Shut it! Let me finish the filming!

07:50.570 --> 07:51.870
Calm down.

07:51.870 --> 07:54.150
We are doing our best too!

07:54.550 --> 07:55.910
After Japan was destroyed,

07:55.910 --> 07:56.770
(A villain's dad! A waste of tax money)
After Japan was destroyed,

07:56.770 --> 07:57.450
(Endeavour owes us an explanation!)
Endeavour had to shoulder

07:57.450 --> 07:59.930
all the responsibilities.

08:00.210 --> 08:03.130
We could have produced
a better image for him.

08:03.130 --> 08:06.890
We should've been the bridge
between the people and heroes.

08:07.290 --> 08:08.730
But we failed!

08:09.310 --> 08:12.270
So we have to record everything
and get it done this time.

08:12.270 --> 08:14.390
This is how the Management Course

08:14.390 --> 08:17.270
does their hero work!

08:20.170 --> 08:22.450
The spirit of U.A. High.

08:23.330 --> 08:28.480
To think I even tried to infiltrate
such a remarkable school…

08:33.750 --> 08:36.210
You guys are amazing!

08:36.210 --> 08:38.390
My phone is getting unstable.

08:38.390 --> 08:41.010
Huh? Nope, my phone is acting on its own!

08:41.010 --> 08:43.230
Was it hacked by the villains?

08:43.230 --> 08:45.910
The electromagnetic barrier was weakened.

08:45.910 --> 08:47.630
So, I took the liberty to use your phone.

08:47.630 --> 08:49.230
Aiba, what are you doing?

08:49.230 --> 08:50.210
U.A. High is the top priority…

08:50.210 --> 08:52.550
It's all taken care of.

08:52.550 --> 08:54.890
I'm working on the next task.

08:54.890 --> 08:57.010
Keep the cameras rolling, heroes.

08:59.210 --> 09:03.510
How could no one see
the heroic charm of Gentle?

09:03.510 --> 09:07.150
Maybe he doesn't mind it,
but I can't allow that.

09:10.670 --> 09:12.350
It's getting lighter.

09:13.030 --> 09:15.390
You did it, La Brava!

09:16.890 --> 09:19.230
I… Must… Protect…

09:19.230 --> 09:22.590
What… must I… protect?

09:23.590 --> 09:25.430
All heroes

09:26.030 --> 09:28.130
must die!

09:31.230 --> 09:34.450
Mr. Aizawa!

09:36.390 --> 09:40.290
No!

09:44.630 --> 09:47.710
Did he just save the teachers?

09:48.230 --> 09:50.810
Maybe the target was Erasure.

09:50.810 --> 09:53.970
It was the most logical way
to assist Shigaraki.

09:54.590 --> 09:58.390
At this point, we can only have faith
and keep on fighting.

09:58.930 --> 10:02.790
Have faith that everyone will be safe
and that we can win this battle.

10:07.330 --> 10:08.950
Have faith in Midoriya.

10:12.720 --> 10:14.000
(My Hero Academia
Gentle Criminal)

10:16.720 --> 10:18.010
(My Hero Academia
Hawks)

10:18.230 --> 10:21.010
(The Gunga Villa Site)

10:24.850 --> 10:27.290
- There are waves of them coming in!
- It's no use! We're outnumbered!

10:27.830 --> 10:32.930
The original plan was for him
to assume my form completely.

10:33.510 --> 10:35.190
Melding my mind with Tomura

10:35.190 --> 10:38.990
to create a new personality
was never the best option.

10:39.390 --> 10:43.970
His impulse for destruction
exceeded my anticipation.

10:44.750 --> 10:47.350
But that remains a minor setback.

10:47.350 --> 10:51.670
If I can inject my Quirk factor into him
now that this body has served its purpose,

10:51.670 --> 10:56.110
I can expand my control
and put a lid on his consciousness.

10:56.110 --> 10:58.710
Then, the true demon lord shall descend.

10:59.790 --> 11:00.990
That is

11:00.990 --> 11:03.750
the tale of my ascension.

11:04.130 --> 11:06.290
I won't let you get to Shigaraki.

11:07.070 --> 11:08.470
This is

11:08.470 --> 11:10.510
our story!

11:11.410 --> 11:12.870
This is about

11:13.270 --> 11:14.670
our future.

11:15.230 --> 11:17.470
For the sake of those kids,

11:17.930 --> 11:22.350
we won't hand it over
to a devourer like you!

11:22.730 --> 11:25.530
We'll go beyond

11:26.530 --> 11:30.330
towards a bright future
where everyone smiles!

11:31.050 --> 11:34.650
But the wind seems to blow my way.

11:51.450 --> 11:54.430
Ouch, I flew a little too fast.

11:54.430 --> 11:55.840
I was really eager to see you.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.750
That was close.

11:59.750 --> 12:01.890
Just an illusion.

12:01.890 --> 12:03.690
That was way too close.

12:03.690 --> 12:07.670
Can't let the pretty boy
die on my watch so easily.

12:08.050 --> 12:11.110
Our mission was to take in
the civilians from U.A. High,

12:11.110 --> 12:14.410
and defend them as much as we could.

12:14.410 --> 12:16.390
But the people never arrived.

12:16.810 --> 12:20.270
Since we deduced the situation
has become too dire out here,

12:20.270 --> 12:22.430
we took it upon ourselves…

12:23.470 --> 12:24.970
Shiketsu High!

12:25.330 --> 12:27.070
All members of the Hero Course…

12:27.070 --> 12:28.170
Wait!

12:28.170 --> 12:30.270
are here to assist!

12:31.030 --> 12:33.250
The wind doesn't just get blown.

12:33.250 --> 12:35.190
We decide where the wind blows!

12:36.070 --> 12:36.810
Is that really

12:36.810 --> 12:38.590
(Shiketsu High, Hero Course)
All For One in the flesh?

12:38.590 --> 12:39.730
(Camie Utsushimi)
But this guy has a face.

12:40.090 --> 12:41.890
(Shiketsu High, Hero Course)
I'd love to kill him

12:41.890 --> 12:43.590
(Seiji Shishikura)
and avenge my father,

12:43.590 --> 12:44.070
(Seiji Shishikura)
but we don't dwell

12:44.070 --> 12:46.030
(Shiketsu High, Hero Course)
on hatred and resentment.

12:46.030 --> 12:48.610
(Inasa Yoarashi)
We'd play right into his hands.

12:49.150 --> 12:52.090
I'll take up his mantle and defend

12:52.090 --> 12:54.090
what my father set out to defend
as a prison guard.

12:54.650 --> 12:56.090
Shishi Kross!

12:56.090 --> 12:58.090
The alumni are here too.

12:58.090 --> 13:01.150
Shigaraki and Deku
seem to have left U.A. High.

13:01.150 --> 13:03.070
This is total chaos.

13:03.070 --> 13:05.070
We have to stop them!

13:07.250 --> 13:11.190
Until we can turn the tide
of the battle, slow down Toga

13:11.190 --> 13:13.310
and fire every ranged attack you have

13:13.990 --> 13:16.670
on All For One!

13:19.950 --> 13:21.690
Are you all right, Hawks?

13:21.690 --> 13:22.990
Officer Tsukauchi.

13:23.410 --> 13:25.610
Our backup came in the nick of time.

13:25.610 --> 13:27.630
I managed to survive.

13:27.630 --> 13:30.470
No, they mobilised

13:30.470 --> 13:32.570
before we even sent the request.

13:33.230 --> 13:36.650
I heard All For One
somehow got his body back.

13:36.950 --> 13:40.470
Whether we can subdue Gunga's threat will
directly decide the outcome of the battle.

13:41.210 --> 13:44.270
Stop All For One at any cost!

13:45.800 --> 13:47.250
(Scattered)

13:47.250 --> 13:50.430
Stealing Quirks with a single touch.

13:51.830 --> 13:56.150
You should've thought about the risk
of sending an army after me.

13:56.690 --> 14:00.970
But now,
you'd take the risk just to stop me.

14:00.970 --> 14:03.370
I get it now.

14:13.470 --> 14:16.650
That monster can use
multiple Quirks again!

14:18.290 --> 14:20.830
All remaining units, keep attacking!

14:20.830 --> 14:22.750
The defenders, stay focused!

14:22.750 --> 14:23.930
Look!

14:23.930 --> 14:25.770
He stopped.

14:25.770 --> 14:28.050
Press on with your attacks!

14:29.050 --> 14:33.530
At this point, do you seriously think
there is a chance of defeating me?

14:34.490 --> 14:38.870
Even without the one man
capable of defeating me?

14:40.070 --> 14:42.150
This is not bravery.

14:42.570 --> 14:46.230
You simply never saw my golden age.

14:47.530 --> 14:52.710
You are the generation who witnessed
All Might's rise at a young age.

14:53.482 --> 14:58.290
By the time you were born,
All Might was already the undefeated.

15:01.130 --> 15:03.790
You've never known the darkest of times.

15:03.790 --> 15:08.590
It was the era when everyone feared
what was lurking in the dark.

15:09.230 --> 15:16.290
The cursed era full of distrust,
rage, exploitation, and discrimination.

15:17.330 --> 15:19.770
No, we all know about that!

15:19.770 --> 15:21.670
I've never met you,

15:22.050 --> 15:25.410
but we read about that
in our contemporary history textbook!

15:26.170 --> 15:30.830
After watching my buddy Todoroki
and his dad Endeavour,

15:30.830 --> 15:32.910
I decided to root for them!

15:33.370 --> 15:37.570
This burning passion will beat this fear!

15:43.310 --> 15:46.590
He channelled the Quirk attacks
using a wind tunnel.

15:47.810 --> 15:50.810
I shall steal them all.

15:54.510 --> 15:56.510
Inasa! Concentrate!

15:56.510 --> 15:59.650
Keep that storm going
and blow the Toga clones into the air!

15:59.650 --> 16:00.910
I got this!

16:00.910 --> 16:06.270
My Quirk gets stronger
as the wind picks up.

16:06.950 --> 16:09.750
Forget about your past glory.

16:09.750 --> 16:15.590
I'm more eager to see the hero
I cheer for build the future!

16:16.210 --> 16:17.730
Endeavour…

16:18.470 --> 16:20.490
You want progress? Here you go.

16:21.490 --> 16:23.070
It's right here.

16:24.430 --> 16:29.490
One For All is the power
that connects the hearts.

16:30.210 --> 16:32.190
It's not just One For All,

16:32.670 --> 16:35.370
you're connected too!

16:37.430 --> 16:39.190
I don't like that look in those eyes.

16:40.210 --> 16:41.990
They aren't even looking at me.

16:42.330 --> 16:44.330
There is still light in them.

16:45.630 --> 16:48.450
Nope, the light should've gone out.

16:48.930 --> 16:52.530
It's like tossing more wood
into the flame to keep it burning.

16:55.190 --> 16:59.570
But they won't approach,
fearing their Quirks might get stolen.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.150
Enough!

17:02.150 --> 17:03.470
Your demise will…

17:06.610 --> 17:08.170
That feels like…

17:11.010 --> 17:13.250
I see what's going on.

17:14.310 --> 17:17.530
Even darkness comes in different flavours.

17:19.530 --> 17:21.670
Don't you dare speak of darkness.

17:23.430 --> 17:26.670
The foul and putrid darkness you created?

17:27.470 --> 17:30.430
We've devoured it.

17:32.790 --> 17:37.350
The sudden storm clouds blocked the sun.

17:37.350 --> 17:39.430
That extended the time limit of my power.

17:40.230 --> 17:43.210
As for the flame,
it's weakened in this storm

17:43.210 --> 17:44.750
that uproots even trees.

17:46.770 --> 17:48.710
All Might told me

17:49.610 --> 17:52.190
that even if you could
get a hold of Endeavour's flame,

17:52.190 --> 17:54.770
his Quirk wouldn't be stolen.

17:55.790 --> 17:59.950
I was chosen to support
Hawks and Endeavour because of this.

18:01.190 --> 18:02.350
Dark Shadow,

18:02.810 --> 18:04.170
Total Release.

18:05.230 --> 18:09.110
He started preparing for this the moment
reinforcement from Shiketsu arrived!

18:09.110 --> 18:10.590
Tokoyami!

18:11.150 --> 18:13.330
Smash him!

18:13.330 --> 18:16.310
A prosperous wind for a boost!

18:21.830 --> 18:26.030
If I were able to get that thought to you,

18:26.030 --> 18:28.830
then it was well worth it
to dirty my wings!

18:36.690 --> 18:39.610
Light of Baldur!

20:12.030 --> 20:13.530
(A few minutes ago)

20:13.530 --> 20:15.690
(A few minutes ago)
Let's rewind a little.

20:16.270 --> 20:17.930
At that moment…

20:19.510 --> 20:24.210
The man who would take his resentment
out on the world

20:24.530 --> 20:28.190
gave the girl a means to
bring ruin to all.

20:30.370 --> 20:31.770
Liar.

20:33.270 --> 20:35.790
These two noticed.

20:38.130 --> 20:41.370
The situation hasn't reached
the "best" part.

20:41.370 --> 20:43.410
However,

20:43.410 --> 20:45.870
it's not the worst either.

21:02.790 --> 21:05.210
This is just my wishful thinking,

21:05.210 --> 21:08.150
things look bad, but the worst
has yet to come.

21:09.050 --> 21:11.850
If she turned into All For One
or Dabi from the get-go,

21:11.850 --> 21:14.270
and then duplicated herself,
it'd be game over instantly.

21:15.050 --> 21:17.330
But she never did that.

21:17.790 --> 21:21.350
Therefore, we can start looking
for a way there!

21:22.110 --> 21:26.490
Twice's clones can use Quirks,

21:27.290 --> 21:30.230
but based on what you've learnt,

21:30.230 --> 21:34.270
Himiko can only use a Quirk
if she loves the person.

21:35.830 --> 21:37.870
Perhaps it was some sort of
compatibility issue?

21:37.870 --> 21:40.550
It seems like the clones
Himiko created with Twice's Quirk

21:40.550 --> 21:44.130
are restricted by the same condition.

21:44.510 --> 21:48.170
Perhaps Shigaraki and the others
are not the people she loves.

21:48.170 --> 21:49.650
Hence, she can't use their Quirks.

21:50.790 --> 21:53.430
I could be totally wrong,

21:53.730 --> 21:56.170
but given how dire the situation is,

21:56.570 --> 22:00.950
that restriction could be overridden
by a split-second emotion.

22:01.510 --> 22:05.130
To prevent the worst from happening,
we must find the real Himiko.

22:06.830 --> 22:08.190
In that case…

22:11.090 --> 22:13.570
Where could she be?

22:16.190 --> 22:17.410
Why?

22:17.950 --> 22:19.390
Why?

22:20.930 --> 22:22.910
Let's continue

22:23.650 --> 22:26.830
this Sad Man's Parade.

22:27.610 --> 22:31.470
I must destroy the heroes.

22:31.470 --> 22:32.770
Why?

22:34.110 --> 22:36.690
I like Tomura and Toya too.

22:37.270 --> 22:41.090
But I can't use their Quirks
like I did with Jin and Ochaco.

22:41.870 --> 22:45.350
Destroy the heroes!

22:46.190 --> 22:48.310
I tried it before the battle began.

22:48.830 --> 22:50.230
It was no use.

22:50.730 --> 22:52.530
I really like them.

22:52.530 --> 22:54.570
I clearly really like them.

22:55.050 --> 22:58.570
Destroy the heroes!

22:59.510 --> 23:02.150
Jin's Quirk works for me!

23:03.610 --> 23:10.930
Destroy the heroes!

23:12.950 --> 23:14.470
Why can't I

23:14.890 --> 23:17.170
become Jin?

23:20.130 --> 23:21.450
(Next Episode)

23:21.450 --> 23:22.870
Next episode.

23:23.530 --> 23:27.790
The worst has come to the heroes.

23:28.630 --> 23:31.410
It's the being that destroys everything
